                                                "sense_id": "a5d000f2-9c8b-34a3-b873-0d0f36977bd9",
                                                "text": "In the rock world, the “Bono talk” is a moment in a young band’s career when the U2 frontman sits up-and-comers down to impart brotherly wisdom."
